Vendored test fixtures from the Cursor plugins repository.

Source:  https://github.com/cursor/plugins
Commit:  c1c0a32
License: each plugin directory carries its own LICENSE file (MIT License,
         Copyright Cursor), vendored beside it unchanged.

Directories and their paths in the source repository:

  thermos/     <- thermos/
  advisor/     <- advisor/
  github/      <- third_party/github/
  xero/        <- third_party/xero/
  playwright/  <- third_party/playwright/
  salesforce/  <- third_party/salesforce/

  .cursor-plugin/marketplace.json <- .cursor-plugin/marketplace.json
    (the whole 79-entry catalogue; the marketplace tests mount the six
    directories above at their source paths and expect the other 73 entries
    to be reported as directories the tree does not hold)

Every text file is a byte-for-byte copy of the source at that commit. The
image files (assets/*.png, assets/*.svg) are zero-byte placeholders of the
same name: the reader never opens them (a logo is an ignored component), and
the tests pin only that they are listed and never read. Nothing under this
directory is formatted, linted or edited; a change here is a re-vendoring at
a new commit and updates this notice.
